    ["<Yellow>Paper Figurine Protection</>: When the master receives fatal damage, it triggers an <Yellow>8</>-second Paper Figurine Protection effect. During this time, the paper figurine absorbs excess damage for the master, increases the master's Control Dodge by <Yellow>*d</> and Control Block by <Yellow>*d</>, and makes the master immune to movement speed reduction effects. The total excess damage absorbed by the paper figurine cannot exceed <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=1?56%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=2?70%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=3?84%}</> of the master's maximum Health. When the limit is reached, the protection effect ends prematurely. \nThe protection effect can be triggered at most once every 120 seconds."] = "<Yellow>Бумажный человечек Protection</>: When the master receives fatal damage, it triggers an <Yellow>8</>-second Бумажный человечек Protection effect. During this time, the Бумажный человечек absorbs excess damage for the master, increases the master's Control Dodge by <Yellow>*d</> and Control Block by <Yellow>*d</>, and makes the master immune to Скорость бега reduction effects. The total excess damage absorbed by the Бумажный человечек cannot exceed <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=1?56%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=2?70%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=3?84%}</> of the master's maximum Health. When the limit is reached, the protection effect ends prematurely. \nThe protection effect can be triggered at most once every 120 seconds.",
